<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.header {
  height: 65pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 18pt 40pt;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 26pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  padding: 2pt 40pt 90pt 40pt;
  flex: 1;
}
.strategy-title {
  font-size: 13pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 3pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
}
.layout {
  display: flex;
  gap: 18pt;
  height: 192pt;
}
.column {
  flex: 1;
}
.chart-box {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 12pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-box h2 {
  font-size: 14pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 8pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>核心策略：哑铃型配置，攻守兼备</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <p class="strategy-title">一手抓硬科技成长，一手抓高红利防守</p>
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="column">
      <div class="chart-box" id="chart1" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
      <div class="chart-box" id="chart2" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
